                                            among Evaxion Biotech A/S (the &ldquo;<U>Company</U>&rdquo;) and the purchasers signatory
                                            thereto (each, a &ldquo;<U>Buyer</U>&rdquo; and, collectively, the &ldquo;<U>Buyers</U>&rdquo;)
                                            and Investment Agreement dated as of December&#8239;_, 2023 (the &ldquo;<U>Investment Agreement</U>&rdquo;;
                                            and, collectively, along with the Securities Purchase Agreement, the &ldquo;<U>Purchase Agreements</U>&rdquo;)
                                            by and among the Company and the investors signatory thereto (each an &ldquo;I<U>nvestor</U>&rdquo;
                                            and collectively the &ldquo;<U>Investors</U>&rdquo;, and, collectively, along with the Buyers,
