<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">The Warrantholder is with effect from December&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;
, 2023 (&ldquo;Grant Date&rdquo;), granted warrants to purchase &#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;&#8239;ordinary shares, DKK 1.00 nominal value per share, of the Company (the
 &ldquo;Ordinary Shares&rdquo;).</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">The subscription of warrants has taken place
by conclusion of this warrant certificate and subject to the terms and conditions set forth in article 2.10.2 of the Company&rsquo;s
articles of association as well as appendix 6 to the Company&acute;s articles of association.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Each warrant confers
the right to subscribe for one (1)&#8239;Ordinary Share at a subscription price, determined by the board, of USD $0.707. </FONT></P>


